<Base title="Method">
  <h1>Authority & Evidence Methodology</h1>
  <p>
    All canonical records in this dataset are backed by evidence anchors that
    point to specific source code locations. Evidence is extracted deterministically
    by static extractors and promoted through a transaction-based canonical pipeline.
  </p>
  <h2>Authority Levels</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Canonical</strong> — sourced from evidence-backed extractors, immutable once promoted.</li>
    <li><strong>Laboratory</strong> — generated or experimental content, never presented as canonical fact.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Evidence Policy</h2>
  <p>
    Public evidence includes locators and short excerpts under CC-BY-4.0.
    Restricted evidence is excluded from projections entirely.
  </p>
</Base>
